         "text": [
            {
                "text": "#### Objetos\n\nEn esta región, varios museos tienen metates como el de la foto. Son piedras usadas para moler maíz.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"http://www.historytracers.org/images/SanJoseCRMuseo/SanJoseCRAntropologia.jpg\" id=\"img0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('img0', '0%')\"  class=\"imgcenter\"/>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Foto tomada en <htdate0></span>, durante una visita al Museo de Antropología de San José, Costa Rica*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "2015",
                     "month": "10",
                     "day": "17"
                  }
               ],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "ba0cae93-4516-4f24-a616-0c0d79372569",
